{"seq":3,"slug":"bus-routing","title":"总线路由与混音架构设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/mixing-engineering/signal-flow/bus-routing","wordCount":1738,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"总线路由与混音架构设计\">总线路由与混音架构设计</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>总线（Bus）是信号路由的汇聚点，总线架构决定了混音项目的组织效率、处理灵活性与最终音质。现代混音普遍采用&quot;通道层 → 编组层 → 主总线&quot;的三层结构，并在其中插入辅助发送与效果返回、VCA 远程控制、Stem 分轨输出与延迟补偿等机制。本篇依次拆解这几种拓扑，说明它们各自解决什么问题、以及何时该用哪一种。</p>\n<h2 id=\"总线层级的系统化思维\">总线层级的系统化思维</h2><p>混音总线（Bus/Buss）是信号路由的汇聚点——多个源通道的信号流入同一条总线，进行统一处理后继续向下游传递。总线架构的设计决定了混音项目的组织效率、处理灵活性和最终音质。</p>\n<p>典型的现代混音采用三层总线结构：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>通道层</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>编组层 (Subgroup)</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>主总线 (Master)</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{通道层} \\to \\text{编组层 (Subgroup)} \\to \\text{主总线 (Master)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">通道层</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">编组层</span><span class=\"mord\"> (Subgroup)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">主总线</span><span class=\"mord\"> (Master)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>总线类型</th>\n<th>功能</th>\n<th>信号方向</th>\n<th>典型数量</th>\n<th>处理内容</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Subgroup</td>\n<td>乐器组聚合</td>\n<td>多通道汇入</td>\n<td>4–12</td>\n<td>组级 EQ/压缩</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Aux Send/Return</td>\n<td>效果共享</td>\n<td>并联分支</td>\n<td>4–8</td>\n<td>混响/延迟</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>VCA</td>\n<td>远程控制（无音频）</td>\n<td>控制信号</td>\n<td>4–8</td>\n<td>组级音量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Master</td>\n<td>最终输出</td>\n<td>唯一出口</td>\n<td>1–2</td>\n<td>母带级处理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Monitor</td>\n<td>监听路由</td>\n<td>不影响录音</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>监听管理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Stem</td>\n<td>分轨输出</td>\n<td>并行输出</td>\n<td>4–8</td>\n<td>交付分轨</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    subgraph 通道层[&quot;输入通道层&quot;]&#10;        K[&quot;Kick&quot;]&#10;        S[&quot;Snare&quot;]&#10;        HH[&quot;Hi-Hat&quot;]&#10;        BG[&quot;Bass Guitar&quot;]&#10;        EG[&quot;Electric Guitar&quot;]&#10;        VX[&quot;Vocal&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 编组层[&quot;Subgroup 层&quot;]&#10;        DB[&quot;Drum Bus&quot;]&#10;        IB[&quot;Instrument Bus&quot;]&#10;        VB[&quot;Vocal Bus&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 效果[&quot;Aux 效果层&quot;]&#10;        RV[&quot;Reverb&quot;]&#10;        DL[&quot;Delay&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 输出[&quot;主输出&quot;]&#10;        MB[&quot;Master Bus&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    K --&gt; DB&#10;    S --&gt; DB&#10;    HH --&gt; DB&#10;    BG --&gt; IB&#10;    EG --&gt; IB&#10;    VX --&gt; VB&#10;    DB --&gt; MB&#10;    IB --&gt; MB&#10;    VB --&gt; MB&#10;    VX --&gt; RV&#10;    EG --&gt; DL&#10;    RV --&gt; MB&#10;    DL --&gt; MB\">flowchart TB\n    subgraph 通道层[\"输入通道层\"]\n        K[\"Kick\"]\n        S[\"Snare\"]\n        HH[\"Hi-Hat\"]\n        BG[\"Bass Guitar\"]\n        EG[\"Electric Guitar\"]\n        VX[\"Vocal\"]\n    end\n    subgraph 编组层[\"Subgroup 层\"]\n        DB[\"Drum Bus\"]\n        IB[\"Instrument Bus\"]\n        VB[\"Vocal Bus\"]\n    end\n    subgraph 效果[\"Aux 效果层\"]\n        RV[\"Reverb\"]\n        DL[\"Delay\"]\n    end\n    subgraph 输出[\"主输出\"]\n        MB[\"Master Bus\"]\n    end\n    K --&gt; DB\n    S --&gt; DB\n    HH --&gt; DB\n    BG --&gt; IB\n    EG --&gt; IB\n    VX --&gt; VB\n    DB --&gt; MB\n    IB --&gt; MB\n    VB --&gt; MB\n    VX --&gt; RV\n    EG --&gt; DL\n    RV --&gt; MB\n    DL --&gt; MB</pre><h2 id=\"subgroup-编组策略\">Subgroup 编组策略</h2><p>编组的目的是将逻辑相关的轨道汇聚后做统一处理。经典分组范式：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>编组名称</th>\n<th>包含轨道</th>\n<th>组级处理目的</th>\n<th>常用插件</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Drum Bus</td>\n<td>Kick, Snare, Toms, OH, Room</td>\n<td>鼓组胶合/冲击力</td>\n<td>Bus Comp, Transient</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Bass Bus</td>\n<td>Bass DI, Bass Amp</td>\n<td>低频一致性</td>\n<td>EQ, Saturation</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Guitar Bus</td>\n<td>多轨吉他</td>\n<td>整体密度</td>\n<td>Comp, Stereo width</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Vocal Bus</td>\n<td>Lead + BG vocals</td>\n<td>人声突出度</td>\n<td>EQ, De-ess, Comp</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Keys/Synth Bus</td>\n<td>键盘/合成器</td>\n<td>频率整理</td>\n<td>EQ, Side-chain</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FX Bus</td>\n<td>所有效果返回</td>\n<td>效果总量控制</td>\n<td>Level, Filter</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>组级压缩（Bus Compression）的核心价值是&quot;胶合感&quot;（Glue）——轻微的压缩（2:1 比率、慢启动）使组内各元素的动态更加协同，创造出&quot;一起演奏&quot;的感觉。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Bus Comp 参数:</mtext><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>Ratio</mtext><mo>≤</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>Attack</mtext><mo>≥</mo><mn>10</mn><mtext> ms</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>GR</mtext><mo>≤</mo><mn>3</mn><mtext> dB</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Bus Comp 参数:} \\quad \\text{Ratio} \\leq 3:1, \\quad \\text{Attack} \\geq 10\\ \\text{ms}, \\quad \\text{GR} \\leq 3\\ \\text{dB}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Bus Comp </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">参数</span><span class=\"mord\">:</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Ratio</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Attack</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ms</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">GR</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">dB</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>VCA（Voltage Controlled Amplifier）编组与 Subgroup 的本质区别：VCA 不路由音频，仅控制多个通道推子的增益。这意味着各通道的 Post-Fader Send 电平会跟随 VCA 变化，但通道各自的总线路由保持不变。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>VCA 通道输出</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>G</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>G</mi><mrow><mi>V</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{VCA 通道输出} = x[n] \\cdot G_{channel} \\cdot G_{VCA}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">VCA </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">通道输出</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">hann</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Subgroup 输出</mtext><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>G</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>(信号实际流经 Bus)</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Subgroup 输出} = \\sum_{i} x_i[n] \\cdot G_i \\quad \\text{(信号实际流经 Bus)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Subgroup </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">输出</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3277em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">(</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">信号实际流经</span><span class=\"mord\"> Bus)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph VCA模式[&quot;VCA 编组&quot;]&#10;        V1[&quot;通道 1&lt;br/&gt;直达 Master&quot;]&#10;        V2[&quot;通道 2&lt;br/&gt;直达 Master&quot;]&#10;        V3[&quot;VCA 推子&lt;br/&gt;远程控制&quot;]&#10;        V3 -.-&gt;|&quot;增益控制&quot;| V1&#10;        V3 -.-&gt;|&quot;增益控制&quot;| V2&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Bus模式[&quot;Subgroup 编组&quot;]&#10;        B1[&quot;通道 1&quot;] --&gt; B3[&quot;Bus&lt;br/&gt;汇总处理&quot;]&#10;        B2[&quot;通道 2&quot;] --&gt; B3&#10;        B3 --&gt; B4[&quot;Master&quot;]&#10;    end\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph VCA模式[\"VCA 编组\"]\n        V1[\"通道 1&lt;br/&gt;直达 Master\"]\n        V2[\"通道 2&lt;br/&gt;直达 Master\"]\n        V3[\"VCA 推子&lt;br/&gt;远程控制\"]\n        V3 -.-&gt;|\"增益控制\"| V1\n        V3 -.-&gt;|\"增益控制\"| V2\n    end\n    subgraph Bus模式[\"Subgroup 编组\"]\n        B1[\"通道 1\"] --&gt; B3[\"Bus&lt;br/&gt;汇总处理\"]\n        B2[\"通道 2\"] --&gt; B3\n        B3 --&gt; B4[\"Master\"]\n    end</pre><h2 id=\"辅助总线与效果路由\">辅助总线与效果路由</h2><p>辅助总线（Auxiliary Bus）实现效果共享——多个通道通过 Send 发送到同一效果总线，经处理后返回主混音。相比在每个通道插入独立的混响实例，Aux 方案节省大量 CPU 资源，同时为所有声源提供统一的空间环境（共同的&quot;房间&quot;感）。</p>\n<p>效果路由的信号流数学：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>b</mi></mrow></msub><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></munderover><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y_{aux}[n] = f_{reverb}\\left(\\sum_{i=1}^{N} s_i \\cdot x_i[n]\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ux</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.106em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">(</span></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><s