</mrow></mpadded></mover><mtext>Delay</mtext><mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"3.0em\">→</mo><mpadded width=\"+0.6em\" lspace=\"0.3em\"><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mpadded></mover><mtext>Reverb Input</mtext><mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"3.0em\">→</mo><mpadded width=\"+0.6em\" lspace=\"0.3em\"><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mpadded></mover><mtext>Master</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Signal} \\xrightarrow{Send} \\text{Delay} \\xrightarrow{Output} \\text{Reverb Input} \\xrightarrow{Output} \\text{Master}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.3025em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Signal</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1081em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.322em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.689em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"height:0.522em;min-width:1.469em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.522em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 522\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 241v40h399891c-47.3 35.3-84 78-110 128\n-16.7 32-27.7 63.7-33 95 0 1.3-.2 2.7-.5 4-.3 1.3-.5 2.3-.5 3 0 7.3 6.7 11 20\n 11 8 0 13.2-.8 15.5-2.5 2.3-1.7 4.2-5.5 5.5-11.5 2-13.3 5.7-27 11-41 14.7-44.7\n 39-84.5 73-119.5s73.7-60.2 119-75.5c6-2 9-5.7 9-11s-3-9-9-11c-45.3-15.3-85\n-40.5-119-75.5s-58.3-74.8-73-119.5c-4.7-14-8.3-27.3-11-40-1.3-6.7-3.2-10.8-5.5\n-12.5-2.3-1.7-7.5-2.5-15.5-2.5-14 0-21 3.7-21 11 0 2 2 10.3 6 25 20.7 83.3 67\n 151.7 139 205zm0 0v40h399900v-40z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.011em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2948em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Delay</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1003em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.322em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">tp</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.689em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"height:0.522em;min-width:1.469em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.522em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 522\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 241v40h399891c-47.3 35.3-84 78-110 128\n-16.7 32-27.7 63.7-33 95 0 1.3-.2 2.7-.5 4-.3 1.3-.5 2.3-.5 3 0 7.3 6.7 11 20\n 11 8 0 13.2-.8 15.5-2.5 2.3-1.7 4.2-5.5 5.5-11.5 2-13.3 5.7-27 11-41 14.7-44.7\n 39-84.5 73-119.5s73.7-60.2 119-75.5c6-2 9-5.7 9-11s-3-9-9-11c-45.3-15.3-85\n-40.5-119-75.5s-58.3-74.8-73-119.5c-4.7-14-8.3-27.3-11-40-1.3-6.7-3.2-10.8-5.5\n-12.5-2.3-1.7-7.5-2.5-15.5-2.5-14 0-21 3.7-21 11 0 2 2 10.3 6 25 20.7 83.3 67\n 151.7 139 205zm0 0v40h399900v-40z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.011em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2948em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Reverb Input</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1003em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.322em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">tp</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.689em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"height:0.522em;min-width:1.469em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.522em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 522\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 241v40h399891c-47.3 35.3-84 78-110 128\n-16.7 32-27.7 63.7-33 95 0 1.3-.2 2.7-.5 4-.3 1.3-.5 2.3-.5 3 0 7.3 6.7 11 20\n 11 8 0 13.2-.8 15.5-2.5 2.3-1.7 4.2-5.5 5.5-11.5 2-13.3 5.7-27 11-41 14.7-44.7\n 39-84.5 73-119.5s73.7-60.2 119-75.5c6-2 9-5.7 9-11s-3-9-9-11c-45.3-15.3-85\n-40.5-119-75.5s-58.3-74.8-73-119.5c-4.7-14-8.3-27.3-11-40-1.3-6.7-3.2-10.8-5.5\n-12.5-2.3-1.7-7.5-2.5-15.5-2.5-14 0-21 3.7-21 11 0 2 2 10.3 6 25 20.7 83.3 67\n 151.7 139 205zm0 0v40h399900v-40z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.011em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Master</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>延迟的回声被混响包裹，创造出远距离的空间感，比单独使用混响的效果更有层次。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[&quot;Lead Vocal&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;Send 1&quot;| B[&quot;Delay Bus&lt;br/&gt;1/4 note&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt;|&quot;Send 2&quot;| C[&quot;Reverb Bus&lt;br/&gt;Plate&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|&quot;串联&quot;| C&#10;    D[&quot;Guitar&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;Send 2&quot;| C&#10;    E[&quot;Synth&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;Send 1&quot;| B&#10;    B --&gt; F[&quot;Master&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; F\">flowchart LR\n    A[\"Lead Vocal\"] --&gt;|\"Send 1\"| B[\"Delay Bus&lt;br/&gt;1/4 note\"]\n    A --&gt;|\"Send 2\"| C[\"Reverb Bus&lt;br/&gt;Plate\"]\n    B --&gt;|\"串联\"| C\n    D[\"Guitar\"] --&gt;|\"Send 2\"| C\n    E[\"Synth\"] --&gt;|\"Send 1\"| B\n    B --&gt; F[\"Master\"]\n    C --&gt; F</pre><h2 id=\"stem-输出与交付格式\">Stem 输出与交付格式</h2><p>Stem 是混音的分组子混音——将最终混音按乐器组分别导出为独立文件，便于后续母带处理、影视混音或 remix。标准 Stem 交付通常包含：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Stem 名称</th>\n<th>内容</th>\n<th>格式</th>\n<th>注意事项</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Drum Stem</td>\n<td>所有打击乐</td>\n<td>WAV 48kHz/24bit</td>\n<td>含 Bus 处理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Bass Stem</td>\n<td>低音乐器</td>\n<td>同上</td>\n<td>含压缩</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Music Stem</td>\n<td>旋律/和声乐器</td>\n<td>同上</td>\n<td>含效果尾音</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Vocal Stem</td>\n<td>所有人声</td>\n<td>同上</td>\n<td>含混响</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FX Stem</td>\n<td>音效/特殊效果</td>\n<td>同上</td>\n<td>含自动化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Full Mix</td>\n<td>完整混音</td>\n<td>同上</td>\n<td>参考</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Stem 导出的关键技术要求：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>S</mi></munderover><msub><mtext>Stem</mtext><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mtext>Full Mix</mtext><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>(相加还原)</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum_{s=1}^{S} \\text{Stem}_s = \\text{Full Mix} \\quad \\text{(相加还原)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.0954em;vertical-align:-1.2671em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8283em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8829em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2671em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Stem</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Full Mix</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">(</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">相加还原</span><span class=\"mord\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>即所有 Stem 不经任何处理直接叠加，应该精确等于完整混音文件。这要求导出时关闭 Master Bus 上的处理（或将其分配到每个 Stem），并确保没有信号遗漏。</p>\n<h2 id=\"延迟补偿与相位对齐\">延迟补偿与相位对齐</h2><p>当信号路径中插入了产生延迟的处理器（如线性相位 EQ、Look-ahead 压缩器、卷积混响），并联路径之间会产生时间偏移。Plugin Delay Compensation（PDC）自动在较短路径上插入等量延迟以对齐：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta t = t_{path\\_long} - t_{path\\_short}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9821em;vertical-align:-0.367em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9821em;vertical-align:-0.367em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>补偿延迟</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>(插入短路径)</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{补偿延迟} = \\Delta t \\quad \\text{(插入短路径)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">补偿延迟</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">(</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">插入短路径</span><span class=\"mord\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>插件类型</th>\n<th>典型延迟</th>\n<th>PDC 影响</th>\n<th>注意事项</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Minimum Phase EQ</td>\n<td>0 samples</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>即时处理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Linear Phase EQ</td>\n<td>1024–8192 samples</td>\n<td>显著</td>\n<td>可能影响实时监听</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Look-ahead Limiter</td>\n<td>64–256 samples</td>\n<td>轻微</td>\n<td>母带标准</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>卷积混响</td>\n<td>IR 长度 / 2</td>\n<td>可能很长</td>\n<td>仅用于非实时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>模拟建模</td>\n<td>0–16 samples</td>\n<td>可忽略</td>\n<td>无延迟问题</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>当 PDC 导致总延迟过大（超过 buffer size 的数倍），实时监听会出现明显延迟感。解决方案包括：低延迟模式（禁用高延迟插件的 PDC）、录音时使用硬件监听（Direct Monitor）、或选择最小相位版本的插件。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[&quot;输入信号&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;路径 A&lt;br/&gt;Linear Phase EQ&lt;br/&gt;延迟 4096 samples&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; C[&quot;路径 B&lt;br/&gt;直通&lt;br/&gt;延迟 0&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; D[&quot;混合点&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt;|&quot;PDC 补偿&lt;br/&gt;+4096 samples&quot;| D&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;相位对齐输出&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    A[\"输入信号\"] --&gt; B[\"路径 A&lt;br/&gt;Linear Phase EQ&lt;br/&gt;延迟 4096 samples\"]\n    A --&gt; C[\"路径 B&lt;br/&gt;直通&lt;br/&gt;延迟 0\"]\n    B --&gt; D[\"混合点\"]\n    C --&gt;|\"PDC 补偿&lt;br/&gt;+4096 samples\"| D\n    D --&gt; E[\"相位对齐输出\"]</pre><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>总线架构分三层：通道层汇聚到 Subgroup 编组层，再汇入 Master；Aux、VCA、Monitor、Stem 是并列的专用路由。</li>\n<li>Subgroup 让逻辑相关的轨道统一处理（Bus Compression 提供&quot;胶合感&quot;）；VCA 只传控制信号不改路由，故能保留各通道原有的 Post-Fader Send 行为。</li>\n<li>Aux Send/Return 用单实例效果实现多通道共享，节省 CPU 并统一空间感；串联 Delay→Reverb 可营造距离递进。</li>\n<li>Stem 是分组子混音，导出时须满足所有 Stem 直接相加等于完整混音。</li>\n<li>并联路径间的相位对齐依赖 PDC；线性相位插件与大卷积混响延迟显著，实时监听时需权衡。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读与跨学科链接\">延伸阅读与跨学科链接</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"../signal-flow/gain-staging\">增益分级与电平管理实践</a>：总线层级的 Bus Trim 与 Master 电平管理，是本篇编组结构的增益落地手段。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../dynamics-processing/parallel-multiband\">并行压缩与多频段动态处理</a>：本篇 Aux Send 路由的经典应用就是并行压缩总线，该篇详解其相位对齐与梳状滤波风险。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../recording-acoustics/recording-practice/multitrack-recording\">多轨录音</a>（录音与声学）：本篇 Stem 与编组的源头是录音阶段的多轨分配，二者构成&quot;录—混&quot;的完整链路。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../audio-signal-processing/audio-effects/reverb-spatial\">音频效果中的混响与空间处理</a>（音频信号处理）：本篇 Aux 混响总线的 DSP 内部实现（卷积/算法混响）在此展开。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"总线路由与混音架构设计","id":"总线路由与混音架构设计"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"总线层级的系统化思维","id":"总线层级的系统化思维"},{"level":2,"text":"Subgroup 编组策略","id":"subgroup-编组策略"},{"level":2,"text":"辅助总线与效果路由","id":"辅助总线与效果路由"},{"level":2,"text":"Stem 输出与交付格式","id":"stem-输出与交付格式"},{"level":2,"text":"延迟补偿与相位对齐","id":"延迟补偿与相位对齐"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读与跨学科链接","id":"延伸阅读与跨学科链接"}],"prev":{"title":"增益分级与电平管理实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/mixing-engineering/signal-flow/gain-staging"},"next":{"title":"频率分布认知与频谱分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/mixing-engineering/frequency-balance/spectral-analysis"}}